To build on Linux the 6th edition Emacs manual bundled with Emacs 18.58:
    cd emacs-18.58/man; tex emacs.tex; dvipdf emacs.dvi

To build on Linux the 7th edition Emacs manual bundled with Emacs 18.59:
    cd emacs-18.59/man; tex emacs.texi; dvipdf emacs.dvi

In each case, the file built is named emacs.pdf.
